    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Cognitive Sandbox.</strong> You have learned to keep the part of your mind that looks at things separate from the part that <em>is</em> those things.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Mind and Soul check</strong> against <strong>illusions, psychic damage, possession, or Tikkun/Qliphothic mind-effects</strong>.</li><li>When you succeed on such a save, the GM may grant you additional diagnostic detail about the effect (what layer it’s coming from, what it’s trying to do, what it’s keyed to).</li></ul>",
